 "behaviour_note": "`behaviour` drives the external agent, never the app. response_delay_hours makes the rehearsal realistic; ghosts:true and gives_delayed_feedback:false exist on purpose so `missing feedback` appears in the funnel denominator instead of being an always-clean simulation.",
